# Topology: context — the BDI/init handshake on its own.
#
# Nothing needs enabling. ContextComponentsContainer starts all four of its
# services (context, BDI, keyword, init) unconditionally, and base.config
# already carries their topics, the BDI model and the init greeting.
#
# The base [cltl.eliza] `intentions:` override is irrelevant here — no
# ElizaService in this topology — but the [cltl.keyword] one is not: the
# container starts KeywordService regardless, and `intentions: eliza` from
# base.config is what TestKeywordQuit depends on. So this overlay exists only to
# keep every topology's configuration in one predictable place.
